# The knowledge of the configuration hindley_milner_baseline
# (gezi.programfamilies.Configurations), the Scott tuple of its two fields,
# each a term of this file and not a choice the host assembles from paths:
# knowledge  the knowledge files the configuration's library is compiled from,
#            occurrence_erasure among them: native_types declares the markers
#            the front end tags occurrences with, and the host tags only with a
#            marker whose erasure lemma the library has
#            (StandardLibraryIndex.occurrenceMarkers)
# enabled    the knowledge whose lemmas its runs enable
# The file is read by projection off the tree whose visible subtree is
# Gezi's directory (StandardLibrary.entryTerm).
# FIXME: this configuration enables native typing (native_types and its https://github.com/Atry/private-overlay/issues/2042
# unions) with no backend, which the rule of CONTRIBUTING.md, "Efficiency by design, with native structures",
# rules out: native types are enabled only where the configured backend
# supports them, and native typing and its backend as one preset of the
# module system. It is the configuration ported from before that rule; it is
# to enable that preset once it is written.
# FIXME: the imports project "corpora" off the variable gezi, the name https://github.com/Atry/private-overlay/issues/1924
# of the project root's own directory; they break if that directory is renamed.
λ export
. (λtuple. tuple λmixin. mixin mixin)
λ omega
. omega (omega (omega (omega gezi "corpora") "compiler") "native_types")
λ native_types
. omega (omega (omega (omega gezi "corpora") "compiler") "hindley_milner_unions")
λ hindley_milner_unions
. omega (omega (omega (omega gezi "corpora") "compiler") "occurrence_erasure")
λ occurrence_erasure
. export
λ s
. s
  (occurrence_erasure + hindley_milner_unions + native_types)
  (hindley_milner_unions + native_types)
